     "Dear all,<div><br></div><div>I wish to add a local image as a clade label. Guangchuang&#39;s book has an example of annotating clades with phylopics but is missing the syntax for annotation using local images. Does anyone know how to do it?</div><div><br></div><div>I have tried specifying geom = &#39;image&#39; and image within aes to &#39;local link&#39;, but without success.</div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:15.75px;overflow:auto;display:block;color:rgb(33,37,41);background-color:rgb(246,246,246);padding:0.5rem;border:1px solid rgb(238,238,238);border-top-left-radius:0.2rem;border-top-right-radius:0.2rem;border-bottom-right-radius:0.2rem;border-bottom-left-radius:0.2rem;background-image:linear-gradient(160deg,rgb(248,248,248) 0px,rgb(241,241,241) 100%)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:inherit;color:inherit;border-top-left-radius:0.2rem;border-top-right-radius:0.2rem;border-bottom-right-radius:0.2rem;border-bottom-left-radius:0.2rem;padding:0px;word-wrap:normal;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(66,84,167)\"><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/pkg/ggtree/man/geom_cladelab.html\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-color:rgb(204,204,204);word-wrap:break-word\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/pkg/ggtree/man/geom_cladelab.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792481307718000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0va-UyS8DFa1PzUCGinmjn\">geom_cladelab</a></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105,105,105)\">(</span>data <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105,105,105)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(25,23,124)\">dt</span>, </span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">              mapping <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105,105,105)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(66,84,167)\"><a href=\"https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-color:rgb(204,204,204);word-wrap:break-word\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792481307718000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1E2am0Uu7IXbl0jnciZEtT\">aes</a></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105,105,105)\">(</span>node <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105,105,105)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(25,23,124)\">node</span>, label <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105,105,105)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(25,23,124)\">name</span>, </span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">                          image <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105,105,105)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(25,23,124)\">link</span>, color <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105,105,105)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(25,23,124)\">name</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105,105,105)\">)</span>, </span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">              geom <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105,105,105)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,128,0)\">&quot;image&quot;</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105,105,105)\">)</span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div>Looking forward to hearing from you.</div><div>Best,</div><div>Martin</div>"
